{"availability":"available","full":"rubiin/tsumiki","name":"tsumiki","description":"modular panel written on fabric","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":236,"forks":19,"created":"2024-11-16T10:12:48Z","updated":"2026-10-07T11:57:01Z","license":"MIT","branch":"master","homepage":"https://tsumikii.pages.dev","topics":["arch-linux","archlinux","fabric","fabric-config","fabric-shell","gtk","hacktoberfest","hyprland","panel","python","python3","waybar","wayland"],"demo":"https://tsumikii.pages.dev/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T08:58:04.211Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-09T08:58:04.211Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-09T08:58:04.211Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-09T08:58:04.211Z","stars":236,"forks":19}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A modular status bar for Hyprland, built on Fabric.","No, this isn't Waybar. Yes, it's written in Python. Yes, it's still fast. 🐍","Tsumiki (積み木 — Japanese for \"building blocks\") is a modular status bar for the Hyprland Wayland compositor. Built on Fabric, it offers a flexible, widget-based architecture for creating custom desktop panels — lightweight, performant, and deeply configurable."],"features":["Hyprland-native — Full integration with Hyprland's ecosystem and event model.","Modular widget system — 45+ widgets: workspaces, system tray, media, battery, CPU, weather, dock, launcher, and more.","Fully themeable — Customize every element with SCSS; generate dynamic Material You color schemes from your wallpaper.","Highly configurable — TOML-based configuration with hot-reload. Control layout, behavior, and appearance of every widget.","Notification system — Built-in notification daemon with Do Not Disturb, grouping, and history persistence."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/rubiin/tsumiki/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"fc63e1f60a152eb688aa74414a2665468130329388b2740fc2445e82b6498a1e","extractedAt":"2026-10-09T08:58:04.332Z"},"overview